     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>考虑&ldquo;越多越好&rdquo;</strong> 如果你特别偏爱某一种颜色，不用担心，大胆地展示出来！跟Cecilia家一样，不需要再额外添加一些强调色，墙壁、座椅、桌布和艺术作品等都选用红色。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "一间纯白色的房间，里面摆放着白色沙发和纺织品。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80228607"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/8a/7b/8a7be3a39237a27264ba1ccdacded0e6.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/8a/7b/8a7be3a39237a27264ba1ccdacded0e6.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>用最简单的颜色，打造最佳装饰效果</strong> 巧妙运用中性色调，打造出层次感。这是用有限配色方案打造最佳装饰效果的简单办法。采用“白上加白”的色调搭配可让小空间显得更加宽敞明亮。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "一间有着黄色墙壁的厨房。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "60176379",
    "70134020"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/37/45/37453e5574341ef089e1264b851c60ae.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/37/45/37453e5574341ef089e1264b851c60ae.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>打造一块特色墙壁，让空间别具一格&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>在开放式设计的餐厅里，颜色可以让空间显得更加独特别致。黄色墙壁可让厨房空间独立出挑。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "一块带有粉红色储物单元的工作空间。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "90169103",
    "s59221537"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/0f/e4/0fe4617ae774994b85a0ca75d7bb36d0.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/0f/e4/0fe4617ae774994b85a0ca75d7bb36d0.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>用斑斓色彩打造心悦神怡的环境</strong> 在这间单间公寓里，设计师Graça想让房间变得趣味十足，同时令艺术材料摆放得井井有序。她挑选了粉红色的储物件，不仅意趣盎然，还有助于将工作空间收纳得干净整齐。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "一个黑色的步入式衣柜。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/37/23/37239689ecad97bfbef28b114e20b56a.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/37/23/37239689ecad97bfbef28b114e20b56a.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>打造独特视觉效果</strong> 巧用黑色营造立体感。黑色可以打造独特的视觉效果，并很好地修饰角落空间。打造开放式储物装置和壁室设计，就像Rebecca的步入式衣柜一样，让人感觉空间非常宽敞。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "橙色墙壁前摆放着蓝色储物柜。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "50322036"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/22/d9/22d9d13a3ad0e6b9cb64f75b16a91a7a.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/22/d9/22d9d13a3ad0e6b9cb64f75b16a91a7a.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>将两种截然不同的颜色搭配在一起</strong> 在色轮上挑选两种截然不同的颜色，比如橙色和蓝色，打造互补的配色方案。尝试重新粉刷旧的木制储物柜，将它摆放在粉刷得五颜六色的墙壁前面，让它分外抢眼。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "绿色扶手椅旁边摆放着盆栽植物和茶几。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "10361044"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/a5/ec/a5ec36826d106c4c21c59eb8fb28ab7d.jpg"
